{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a desolate world as you uncover the fate of those who came before. Solve puzzles, interact with a decaying yet beautiful landscape, and rely on your companion to endure a journey of loss, hope, and discovery. In this atmospheric 2.5D adventure, the world remembers\u2014even if no one else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lost, But Never Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Friendship_Dynamics.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The world is empty, but you are not alone. A steadfast companion walks beside you, a quiet reminder that hope still lingers. In a place where everything has crumbled, only together can you find the strength to move forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The world may be fractured, but its mechanisms still hold purpose.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Puzzle_Solving.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pathways have crumbled.\u00a0<br><br>Abandoned machines whisper forgotten functions, leaving behind challenges no one was meant to face, but the answers lie in the world itself\u2014if you know where to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE THAN A SETTING, A PRESENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Interactive_Environment.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were built to navigate, adapt and process data. Yet, as you step into the landscape, your systems flag something untraceable through the logs. The air is heavy, the silence intrusive. This is not just a place\u2014it is a memory. And it lingers within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A WORLD THAT SPEAKS WITHOUT WORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Enviromental_storytelling_in_a_post_apocalyptic_dystopian_world.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ruins hold echoes of the past, their story told in silent remnants and shifting shadows. Every flickering light, every faint transmission\u2014each a sign of what led to this emptiness. Will you piece it together?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310850?t=1744275826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310850?t=1744275826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/4df2ca1e83358b17cefc44317f89fee3aa370957/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744275826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/4df2ca1e83358b17cefc44317f89fee3aa370957/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744275826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a desolate world as you uncover the fate of those who came before. Solve puzzles, interact with a decaying yet beautiful landscape, and rely on your companion to endure a journey of loss, hope, and discovery. In this atmospheric 2.5D adventure, the world remembers\u2014even if no one else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lost, But Never Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Friendship_Dynamics.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The world is empty, but you are not alone. A steadfast companion walks beside you, a quiet reminder that hope still lingers. In a place where everything has crumbled, only together can you find the strength to move forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The world may be fractured, but its mechanisms still hold purpose.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Puzzle_Solving.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pathways have crumbled.\u00a0<br><br>Abandoned machines whisper forgotten functions, leaving behind challenges no one was meant to face, but the answers lie in the world itself\u2014if you know where to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE THAN A SETTING, A PRESENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Interactive_Environment.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were built to navigate, adapt and process data. Yet, as you step into the landscape, your systems flag something untraceable through the logs. The air is heavy, the silence intrusive. This is not just a place\u2014it is a memory. And it lingers within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A WORLD THAT SPEAKS WITHOUT WORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310850/extras/Enviromental_storytelling_in_a_post_apocalyptic_dystopian_world.gif?t=1744275826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ruins hold echoes of the past, their story told in silent remnants and shifting shadows. Every flickering light, every faint transmission\u2014each a sign of what led to this emptiness. Will you piece it together?</p>","developers":["2024studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","i